  intro_message = coalesce(intro_message, $$Thanks for connecting, Justin. Cast Influence has a differentiated model that blends PR, digital marketing, SEO, community, and fractional CMO guidance. The current role creates an opportunity to strengthen the system connecting client strategy, delivery workflows, account health, business-impact reporting, renewals, and expansion. I have built similar connective systems across marketing, CRM, analytics, and revenue operations. My approach is here: https://www.aboutchad.com/approach$$),
