  intro_message = coalesce(intro_message, $$Thanks for connecting, Jessica. Zone & Co is scaling a multi-product financial-operations platform across more than 4,000 customers while continuing to expand through product innovation and acquisition. The revenue-marketing role suggests the next challenge is connecting positioning, segments, demand programs, CRM and lifecycle governance, attribution, and executive measurement into one repeatable growth model. I have led that type of work across fragmented CRM, marketing automation, customer, call-center, and operational systems, including helping scale digital revenue from $400M to $1.25B at QXO. Through RevHub, my partner Harsh and I bring both the commercial strategy and analytics depth needed to accelerate the build without adding several isolated specialists. Our approach is here: https://www.aboutchad.com/approach$$),
  follow_up_message = coalesce(follow_up_message, $$Jessica, one practical starting point could be a portfolio growth map connecting priority finance personas and use cases to product mix, acquisition source, account engagement, pipeline stage, sales handoff, adoption, retention, and expansion. That would give Marketing, Sales, RevOps, and Customer Success one shared view of where growth is being created and where the operating model needs reinforcement.$$)
