  intro_message = coalesce(intro_message, $$Thanks for connecting, Steven. Zone & Co's continued growth, global expansion, and multi-product platform create a broader challenge than demand generation alone. Revenue leadership needs one operating view across target segments, account engagement, marketing influence, sales conversion, forecasting, customer adoption, retention, and expansion. I have built commercial systems that connect those layers across CRM, marketing automation, customer data, analytics, and executive reporting. Through RevHub, my partner Harsh and I can augment an internal GTM team with commercial architecture, segmentation, KPI governance, forecasting, dashboards, and implementation capacity without creating another silo. Our approach is here: https://www.aboutchad.com/approach$$),
  follow_up_message = coalesce(follow_up_message, $$Steven, a focused first phase could define the shared revenue model across account tiers, buying signals, marketing engagement, qualification, opportunity stages, forecast inputs, product adoption, and expansion. That would clarify which growth questions are limited by data, which are process issues, and where a fractional team could accelerate the internal roadmap.$$)
